flowchart LR
    subgraph RPi [Raspberry Pi]
        SENSE[Sense HAT joystick] --> DOORBELL[doorbell_camera.py]
        CAM[Pi Camera] --> DOORBELL

        DOORBELL --> IMG[Image file: static/last_visitor.jpg]
        DOORBELL --> STATE[State file: state/doorbell.json]
    
        DASH["web_dashboard.py (Flask app)"] --> IMG
        DASH --> STATE
    end
    
    BROWSER[Student laptop web browser] -->|HTTP| DASH


![image-20251124095115527](./img/99/image-20251124095115527.png)

flowchart LR
    subgraph RPi [Raspberry Pi]
        SENSE[Sense HAT joystick] --> DOORBELL[doorbell_camera.py]
        CAM[Pi Camera] --> DOORBELL
        DOORBELL --> UPLOADER[img_upload.py]
    end

    UPLOADER -->|upload image| CLOUD[Cloudinary image storage]
    
    DOORBELL -->|publish state with URL| MQTT[MQTT broker]
    
    subgraph Render [Render platform]
        DASH[web_dashboard.py]
    end
    
    DASH -->|subscribe to state| MQTT
    DASH -->|use image URL| CLOUD
    
    BROWSER[Student web browser] -->|HTTPS| DASH